<main class="main-wrapper responsivegrid aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12" id="main-content">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">

    <div class="hero-banner cmp-hero-banner--height-large cmp-hero-banner__overlay cmp-hero-banner--text-alignment-vertical-bottom aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div class="cmp-hero-banner" id="hero-banner-76d39254d5">





            <div class="cmp-hero-banner__container">
                <div class="cmp-hero-banner__bg-img cmp-image" data-dynamic-media-image="false" data-lazy-loaded="false" data-src="/assets-f/img/e078441438549b.jpg" data-widths="128,256,512,1024,1280,1440,1920,2048">
                    <picture class="cmp-image__picture">
                        <img class="cmp-image__image" data-cmp-hook-image="image" itemprop="contentUrl" alt="Fiserv Forum exterior at sunrise" loading="eager" src="/assets-f/img/ccd07b03602902.jpg">
                    </picture>
                </div>
                <div class="cmp-hero-banner__content">
                    <div class="cmp-hero-banner__text"><div class="text cmp-text--text-white">
<div class="cmp-text" id="text-fc05775002">
    <p><span class="eyebrow">Milwaukee, WI</span></p>
<h1>Fiserv Forum</h1>
<h5>How do you build a fan-focused sports arena?</h5>

</div>



</div>
</div>
                    <div class="cmp-hero-banner__cta"><div class="cta button">






</div>
</div>
                    <div class="cmp-hero-banner__xf"><div class="xf experiencefragment">




</div>
</div>
                </div>
            </div>



</div>




</div>
<div class="section cmp-section--site-width-1248 cmp-section--padding32 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div class="cmp-section " id="section-90eee95b99">


    <div class="cmp-section__container" data-background-image="false" data-dynamic-media-image="false" data-lazy-loaded="true">




<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">

    <div class="grid-container cmp-grid-container--2col-8-4 cmp-grid-container--mobile-reverse aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div class="cmp-grid-container" id="grid-container-7d79b1fdb6">


    <div class="cmp-grid-container__items">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">

    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div class="cmp-text" id="text-09e51bcc37">
    <p>Home to the NBA's Milwaukee Bucks and Marquette University Men’s Basketball, Fiserv Forum is a multi-purpose arena that serves as the cornerstone of sports and entertainment in downtown Milwaukee. The arena provides a superb fan experience via open concourses, social spaces in view of the action, and a variety of experiential and premium seating options. A public-private partnership, Fiserv Forum was built for the community, and boasts an intimate seating configuration with most of the seats in the lower bowl.</p>
<p>During preconstruction, the Mortenson team worked with the design team to evaluate the efficiency of a recessed event floor versus having it at grade. After considering many factors such as the foundations and high water table, exterior enclosure impacts, vertical circulation and the fan experience, it was determined the project could save nearly $30M by not recessing the event floor. Today, the eye-catching facade features an immense wall of glass that reveals the activity going on inside the arena.</p>
</div>



</div>
<div class="project-data aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

     <div id="project-data-392698b7fb--projectdata" class="project-data-container closed cmp-contentfragment" data-cmp-contentfragment-model="global/models/project-data" data-cmp-contentfragment-path="/content/dam/mortenson/global-assets/projects/content-fragments/fiserv-forum">
          <dl id="completionDate">
               <dt>Completion Date</dt>
               <dd><p>July 2018</p></dd>
          </dl>

          <dl id="projectCost">
               <dt>Project Cost</dt>
               <dd><p>$524,000,000</p></dd>
          </dl>

          <dl id="deliveryMethod">
               <dt>Delivery Method</dt>
               <dd class="cmp-contentfragment__element-value">
                    <p>Construction Manager at Risk</p>
               </dd>
          </dl>

          <dl id="relatedOG">
               <dt>Related</dt>
               <dd class="cmp-contentfragment__element-value">
                    <p><a href="#">Sports + Entertainment</a></p>
<p><a href="#">Milwaukee</a></p>
               </dd>
          </dl>

          <dl id="leedStatus">
               <dd><p>LEED/Sustainability Certified</p></dd>
          </dl>

          <dl id="factsFigures" class="hide" hidden="">
               <dt>Additional Project Facts</dt>
               <dd class="cmp-contentfragment__element-value">
                    <p>730,000 Square Feet</p>
<p>17,500 Seats</p>
               </dd>
          </dl>

          <a href="#" class="project-data-expander" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="factsFigures">
               <span class="icon"></span> EXPAND
          </a>
     </div>

</div>


</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="section cmp-section--site-width-1248 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div class="cmp-section " id="section-8b3a80612d">


    <div class="cmp-section__container" data-background-image="false" data-dynamic-media-image="false" data-lazy-loaded="true">




<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">

    <div class="stat cmp-stat--background-overlay aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div class="cmp-stat">
    <p class="cmp-stat__eyebrow eyebrow">fiserv</p>
    <div class="cmp-stat__stat-card-wrapper">
        <div class="cmp-stat__stat-card">
          <h3 class="cmp-stat__stat-value">43%</h3>
          <p class="cmp-stat__stat-proposition">achieved at Resident Preference Programs, surpassing our 40% goal</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cmp-stat__stat-card">
          <h3 class="cmp-stat__stat-value">283</h3>
          <p class="cmp-stat__stat-proposition">Wisconsin-based companies built Fiserv Forum (76% of total companies)</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>



</div>


</div>

    </div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="text cmp-text--padding-32 aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div class="cmp-text" id="text-ea9d644241">
    <p>Mortenson also installed the arena's distributed antenna system (DAS), improving the fan experience by ensuring fans always have a signal to their phone. Working closely with both the owner and operator of the DAS and the provider to coordinate the installation of the 400+ antennas, miles of conduit and cabling, and all the associated equipment required allowed Mortenson to integrate the installation with the master construction schedule. Further, Mortenson was able to hide or disguise nearly all the antennas and conduit, such that there are virtually no visible antennas in the arena.&nbsp;<a href="#">Click here</a>&nbsp;to learn more about DAS and our Digital Integration capabilities.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.fiservforum.com/about/the-vision" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Click here</a>&nbsp;to learn more about the vision for Fiserv Forum.</p>

</div>



</div>


</div>

    </div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="section cmp-section--site-width-1248 cmp-section--remove-top-padding aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<div class="cmp-section " id="section-f556775243">


    <div class="cmp-section__container" data-background-image="false" data-dynamic-media-image="false" data-lazy-loaded="true">




<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">

    <div class="carousel cmp-carousel--thumbnail-view aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">

<section class="cmp-carousel play-enabled" id="carousel-343000312b" role="group" aria-live="polite" aria-roledescription="carousel" data-cmp-is="carousel" data-cmp-delay="5000" data-cmp-number-of-slides="1" data-cmp-slides-per-group="1" data-cmp-a11y-label-slide="Slide {0}" data-placeholder-text="false">


